Package: rusty-calendar-pi
Version: 0.1.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: armhf
Depends: libc6, libegl1, libgles2
Maintainer: Yoram Delangen
Description: Small calendar UI for Raspberry Pi with e-paper display
 A lightweight calendar display that runs directly on DRM/KMS
 without X11 or Wayland, optimized for low CPU usage.
